{% comment %}
  Shared reference for Incident.io TRMNL Plugin
  NOTE: This file is NOT prepended by the gem. Each layout is self-contained.
  This exists as documentation of the counting logic and data structure.

  Counting logic (duplicated in each layout):
    - active_count: incidents where category == "live"
    - learning_count: incidents where category == "learning"
    - critical_count: active incidents where severity.name == "P1"
    - total_count: active_count + learning_count

  Incident card fields:
    - incident.reference (e.g. "INC-123")
    - incident.name (clamped to 1 line)
    - incident.incident_status.name (e.g. "Investigating")
    - incident.severity.name (P1-P5, drives emphasis class)
    - incident.created_at (formatted as "Mar 14 14:30")
    - Incident Lead: extracted from incident_role_assignments via manual loop
    - Affected teams: extracted from custom_field_entries via manual loop
{% endcomment %}
